            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW111473425 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW111473425 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="citation-1869" data-ccp-charstyle-defn="{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;3a907493-7cb5-5109-ae98-5f5d573e66d9|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;citation-1869&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;citation-1869&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}"&gt;Lifting weights daily is an activity that improves physical wellness by building muscular strength and endurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW111473425 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;, not intellectual wellness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW111473425 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="8164_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW118948965 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW118948965 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;Meditation is a stress management technique that can contribute to emotional or spiritual wellness, but it is not primarily listed &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun AdvancedProofingIssueV2Themed SCXW118948965 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;as a way to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW118948965 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt; improve intellectual wellness through cognitive development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW118948965 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="2517_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW246183777 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW246183777 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="citation-1868" data-ccp-charstyle-defn="{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;f48089b3-1df6-53f6-a6a3-9fd223ef0594|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;citation-1868&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;citation-1868&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}"&gt;Engaging in social events strengthens social wellness by fostering interactions and connections with others&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW246183777 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;, rather than directly improving intellectual &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW246183777 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;capacities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW246183777 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW246183777 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
